      "ourRendering": "‘Evam’ — thus — is glossed. ‘Thus’, by way of my teaching: having known and directly experienced the discerned jīva-self — concentrated bliss-consciousness, higher than buddhi too, because buddhi is the instigator of the entire class of insentient things beginning with the body — that is the sense. By the self — that is, by buddhi of this kind, whose nature is such ascertainment — having steadied the manas upon the self, having made it firm in the self of that sort: slay — destroy — this enemy having the form of kāma, though hard to approach, hard to overpower. ‘mahā-bāho’ — as before.",
